  "claim": "Substitutable reasoning, controlled mutation. Different reasoning strategies inspect the document model and propose supported edits through a common typed changeset interface. A controlled applier executes those edits; provenance and independent validation provide evidence about the result. The drawing shows the PDF changeset path. Some PDF operations still mutate directly outside this interface.",
