  "alt": "Three equal reasoning-strategy boxes\u2014structured pipeline, general-purpose agent, and human-directed editing\u2014converge on a typed changeset containing target, operation, and arguments from a closed mutation vocabulary. The PDF path continues through a controlled applier that resolves targets, checks preconditions, applies supported mutations, and records outcomes; a structured document model of typed PDF objects; and a result with applied-operation provenance and independent validation. A return arrow makes the model available to all reasoning strategies for inspection. A separate dashed note says that some PDF operations still mutate directly outside the common changeset interface. Other formats have their own model implementations.",
